# AssimpForUnreal test fixture: two triangles, one per material in Specular.mtl.
#
# The geometry is irrelevant and deliberately minimal -- this fixture exists only to carry two
# Phong materials through the importer. Two separate triangles rather than one, because Assimp
# splits a mesh per material and a single face could only ever carry one.
mtllib Specular.mtl

v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
v 2.0 0.0 0.0
v 3.0 0.0 0.0
v 2.0 1.0 0.0

usemtl MatShiny
f 1 2 3

usemtl MatDull
f 4 5 6
